= March 18th Massacre

Feng Yuxiang's army and Japanese ships reportedly opened fire against eachother.

The KMT and CPC used this as a pretense to spark anti-imperialist protests in Beijing. The Beiyang Government subsequently cracked down on these protests and issued arrest warrants for KMT and CPC leaders, including Li Dazhao and Xu Qian.

This has strengthened our support and the Northern Warlords of the Beiyang Government face the blame.
